BonusTest
├── When the bonus coin flip wins
│   └── It should reserve a box and allow independent claims.
├── When the bonus coin flip loses
│   └── It should leave every box available.
├── When the last box is awarded but unclaimed
│   └── It should not be awarded again.
├── When boxes are replenished
│   └── It should resume the bonus on a later eligible draw.
├── When a box arrives after cutoff or after randomness
│   └── It should not change the locked bonus.
├── When a bonus transfer fails
│   └── It should preserve the bonus claim and permit the main claim.
├── When a different account claims a bonus
│   └── It should revert.
├── When a won box returns
│   └── It should be reusable without reopening the previous claim.
├── When three wizards share the prize pool
│   └── It should draw every wizard alongside warriors without replacement.
├── When a finalized bonus survives shutdown
│   └── It should remain reserved while unassigned boxes are recoverable.
└── When the callback contains an incorrect number of words
    └── It should ignore it and accept the subsequent valid response.
